<html lang="en">Apsolutno, hajdemo redizajnirati i glavnu **Blog** stranicu (`src/pages/blog/index.astro`) da se savršeno uklapa u tamni estetski stil sa grid karticama, efektima stakla (glassmorphism) i sjajnim hover animacijama!

Evo kompletnog novog koda za **Blog** stranicu.

---

### Korak 1: Izmena `src/pages/blog/index.astro`

1. Otvori fajl **`src/pages/blog/index.astro`** u VS Code-u.
2. Zameni sav postojeći kod sledećim kodom:

```astro
---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../../consts';
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';

const posts = (await getCollection('blog')).sort(
	(a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf()
);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead ${SITE_TITLE}`} & - Reviews description="{SITE_DESCRIPTION}" title="{`Blog"/>
		<style is:global>
			body {
				background-color: #0b0f17 !important;
				color: #cbd5e1 !important;
			}
		</style>
		<style>
			main {
				max-width: 960px;
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 3em 1em;
			}
			.blog-header {
				text-align: center;
				margin-bottom: 3em;
			}
			.blog-header h1 {
				font-size: 2.8em;
				color: #f8fafc;
				margin-bottom: 0.3em;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff 0%, #93c5fd 100%);
				-webkit-background-clip: text;
				-webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
			}
			.blog-header p {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 1.15em;
				max-width: 600px;
				margin: 0 auto;
			}
			.posts-grid {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
				gap: 2em;
				list-style-type: none;
				padding: 0;
				margin: 0;
			}
			.post-card {
				background: rgba(17, 24, 39, 0.8);
				backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
				border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
				border-radius: 16px;
				padding: 2em;
				transition: all 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
				display: flex;
				flex-direction: column;
				justify-content: space-between;
			}
			.post-card:hover {
				transform: translateY(-6px);
				border-color: #3b82f6;
				box-shadow: 0 20px 30px -10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.25);
			}
			.post-card h2 {
				margin: 0 0 0.5em 0;
				font-size: 1.4em;
			}
			.post-card h2 a {
				color: #f8fafc;
				text-decoration: none;
				transition: color 0.2s ease;
			}
			.post-card h2 a:hover {
				color: #60a5fa;
			}
			.post-card p {
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 0.95em;
				line-height: 1.6;
				margin-bottom: 1.5em;
			}
			.date {
				color: #64748b;
				font-size: 0.85em;
				margin-bottom: 0.8em;
				display: block;
			}
			.read-more {
				font-weight: 700;
				color: #60a5fa;
				text-decoration: none;
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				gap: 0.4em;
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header/>
		<main>
			<div class="blog-header">
				<h1>All Reviews & Verdicts</h1>
				<p>Explore our latest technical breakdowns, comparisons, and benchmarks of developer tools.</p>
			</div>

			<section>
				<ul class="posts-grid">
					{
						posts.map((post) => (
							<li class="post-card">
								<div>
									<span class="date">
										{post.data.pubDate.toLocaleDateString('en-us', {
											year: 'numeric',
											month: 'short',
											day: 'numeric',
										})}
									</span>
									<h2>
										<a href={`/blog/${post.slug}/`}>{post.data.title}</a>
									</h2>
									<p>{post.data.description}</p>
								</div>
								<a href={`/blog/${post.slug}/`} class="read-more">Read Full Verdict &rarr;</a>
							</li>
						))
					}
				</ul>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer/>
	</body>
</html>